 gazebo on the large deck, a trampoline, and back-alley access, offering potential for an additional garage or RV parking. This home will impress even the fussiest buyer (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$725,999"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","6"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,480 sq ft"],["Lot size","10,120 sq ft"],["Year built","2017"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Tamarack"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6T2E4"],["MLS® number","E4506622"],["Listed","September 2, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Alarm System, Hood Fan, See remarks, Storage Shed, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Heat Pump, Forced air"],["Fireplace","Gas, Heatillator"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.08 m × 4.28 m (16'8\" × 14'1\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.34 m × 2.41 m (10'11\" × 7'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.08 m × 4.62 m (10'1\" × 15'2\")"],["Family room","Basement","6.40 m × 3.99 m (21'0\" × 13'1\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.01 m × 4.60 m (13'2\" × 15'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.83 m × 3.45 m (9'3\" × 11'4\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.50 m × 2.81 m (11'6\" × 9'3\")"],["Bedroom 4","Main level","3.64 m × 3.09 m (11'11\" × 10'2\")"],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","5.56 m × 4.68 m (18'3\" × 15'4\")"],["Bedroom 5","Basement","3.51 m × 3.57 m (11'6\" × 11'9\")"],["Bedroom 6","Basement","3.04 m × 3.65 m (10'0\" × 12'0\")"]],"courtesy":"Darrell Ketler, Century 21 All Stars Realty Ltd and Heather Leslie, Century 21 All Stars Realty Ltd","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"tamarack","area":"southeast-edmonton"}